# A rename asks the owners of the files it relinks for their new texts before anything moves
# (docs/extensions.md, "Owners and types, as built"). tests/drive.rs installs a csv-table that
# refuses a rename to Krakatau and never answers one to Rakata: each rename is cancelled with the
# owner's reason, and tests/drive.rs checks every file of the workspace is as it was.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys /
type krakatoa
wait-for Krakatoa
keys enter
wait-for ← Eruptions.csv  | Krakatoa | 1883 | 6 |
keys R
wait-for rename · ⏎ preview · Esc cancel
keys ctrl+u
type Krakatau
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md  →  Volcanoes/Krakatau.md
keys enter
wait-for 12s rename cancelled, nothing was changed: csv-table didn't edit Volcanoes/Eruptions.csv: this copy keeps the old names
expect ← Eruptions.csv  | Krakatoa | 1883 | 6 |
# An owner that doesn't answer: the dialog says what it waits for, and gives up after 10 s.
keys R
wait-for rename · ⏎ preview · Esc cancel
keys ctrl+u
type Rakata
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md  →  Volcanoes/Rakata.md
keys enter
wait-for waiting for csv-table to update its files · Esc cancel
screen
wait-for 15s rename cancelled, nothing was changed: csv-table didn't edit Volcanoes/Eruptions.csv: it didn't answer file/edit in 10 s
# Esc stops waiting.
keys R
wait-for rename · ⏎ preview · Esc cancel
keys ctrl+u
type Rakata
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md  →  Volcanoes/Rakata.md
keys enter
wait-for waiting for csv-table to update its files · Esc cancel
keys esc
wait-for rename cancelled
expect ← Eruptions.csv  | Krakatoa | 1883 | 6 |
screen
keys q
exits 0
